    · exact h673 p hpe
    · exact h674 p hpe
    · exact h675 p hpe
    · exact h676 p hpe
  refine eqAll_sound t5 _ _ (assoc bls) hbl adv 1000 advOk c h1 ?_
  rw [adv_len]; exact h2

